## Part 11 — Evidence Report (`codemind-playwright-report.md`)

The deliverable that makes this a CodeMind playbook rather than a script runner.
Every section is evidence-backed; absence is explicit.

### 11.1 Run Summary
| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| Target URL | … |
| Scenario (NL) | … |
| Channel | CLI / MCP |
| Playwright version | … |
| Auth | anonymous / storageState |
| Result | PASS / PASS-WITH-SKIPS / ESCALATED |

### 11.2 Plan → Test Traceability Matrix
| Plan step | Test file:case | Status | Evidence artifact | Confidence |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1.1 Add item to cart | `cart.spec.ts › adds item` | ✅ pass | `trace-1.1.zip` | High |
| 1.2 Apply coupon | `cart.spec.ts › coupon` | ⏭️ skipped | healer note | — |
| 1.3 Gated checkout | — | 🚫 not tested | no session | — |

### 11.3 Locator Provenance
| Element (user-facing) | Locator emitted | Rung | Live-grounded? | Reason if rung > 1 |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| "Add to cart" button | `getByRole('button', {name:/add to cart/i})` | 1 | yes | — |
| price field | `getByTestId('unit-price')` | 4 | yes | no role/label/text anchor present |

### 11.4 Stability
| Spec | `--repeat-each` | Passes | Verdict |
|---|---|---|---|
| `cart.spec.ts` | 10 | 10/10 | Stable |

### 11.5 Explicit Absences & Escalations
- `Not tested — [gated checkout]: no authenticated session available.`
- `Escalated — [scenario 2.3]: Healer hit iteration cap; suspected real
  regression. Trace: …`

### 11.6 Confidence Statement
A one-paragraph, honest assessment: what is genuinely verified by evidence, what
is assumed, and what a human still needs to review. No green-washing.

