## Part 12 — Dual-Target Support (Side-by-Side)

CodeMind's dual-repository pattern adapts here as **dual-target**: run the same
`nl_scenario` against two URLs (e.g., staging vs production, or v1 vs v2 of a UI)
and produce a comparison.

| Step | Target A result | Target B result | Divergence |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1.1 Add to cart | ✅ pass | ✅ pass | none |
| 1.2 Apply coupon | ✅ pass | ❌ fail | coupon field absent on B |

Divergences are reported as observed facts with artifacts, never as inferred
causes.

