## Part 14 — Quick Reference

```bash
# 0. one-time scaffold (regenerate after each Playwright upgrade)
npx playwright init-agents --loop=copilot

# 1. preflight
npx playwright --version && npx playwright install chromium

# 2. plan (Planner agent)  → specs/<slug>.md   [then human checkpoint]
# 3. generate (Generator)  → tests/<slug>.spec.ts   [reference scenario by number]
# 4. execute
npx playwright test --reporter=html

# 5. stability gate
npx playwright test tests/<slug>.spec.ts --repeat-each=10

# 6. heal failures (Healer, cap=3) → escalate if unfixed
# 7. write codemind-playwright-report.md
```

